UID:rocky-mountain-half-marathon-5k-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260731T180000Z
DTEND:20260731T220000Z
SUMMARY:Rocky Mountain Half Marathon & 5K
DESCRIPTION:A scenic half marathon and 5K race in the Estes Valley just outside Rocky Mountain National Park. The race starts and ends by the lake at the fairgrounds in historic Estes Park\, Colorado\, featuring killer mountain views of the Continental Divide. Runners experience alpine views\, high elevation paced loops\, and iconic landscapes with sweeping vistas of jagged granite peaks.
LOCATION:Stanley Park Ball Field\, Estes Park\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wild-west-relay-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260731T050000Z
DTEND:20260731T090000Z
SUMMARY:Wild West Relay
DESCRIPTION:A scenic point-to-point relay race across Colorado starting in Fort Collins and finishing 200 miles away in Steamboat Springs. Teams of 1-12 runners navigate mountain passes\, open spaces\, and roads. Available team configurations include 12-person teams\, Ultra teams (4-6 runners)\, Super Ultra teams (1-3 runners)\, and High School teams. Registration ends July 31\, 2026 at 11:59 PM MDT.
LOCATION:Budweiser Brewing Plant (Anheuser Busch Facility)\, Fort Collins\, CO 80524
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rocky-mountain-half-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260801T060000Z
DTEND:20260801T100000Z
SUMMARY:Rocky Mountain Half Marathon
DESCRIPTION:A challenging but scenic running event just outside Rocky Mountain National Park. The race starts and ends by the lake at the fairgrounds in historic Estes Park\, Colorado with stunning mountain views. The 5K features a counterclockwise loop around Lake Estes with an aggressive initial climb\, while the Half Marathon includes elevation gain of +1\,267 ft / -1\,263 ft with a 4.5-hour cutoff.
LOCATION:Stanley Park Ball Field\, Estes Park\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
