UID:aspen-backcountry-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260801T060000Z
DTEND:20260801T100000Z
SUMMARY:Aspen Backcountry Marathon
DESCRIPTION:The Aspen Backcountry returns on August 1\, 2026 with a 50 Kilometer distance to complement the marathon and 'heavy half' marathon. Hosted next to the Duck Derby fundraising event by the Rotary Club Aspen. All participants must obtain a valid CORSAR card for the day of the event. Start times: 50K at 6:00 AM\, Marathon at 7:30 AM\, Heavy Half Marathon at 8:00 AM.
LOCATION:N Mill St and Rio Grande Place\, Aspen\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
