UID:transrockies-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260803T080000Z
DTEND:20260803T120000Z
SUMMARY:TransRockies Run
DESCRIPTION:A multi-day trail running stage race often described as 'Summer Camp for Runners.' Participants traverse the heart of the Rockies over six days\, finishing in Beaver Creek.
LOCATION:East Main Street\, Buena Vista\, CO 81211
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:choice-city-running-festival-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260807T080000Z
DTEND:20260807T120000Z
SUMMARY:Choice City Running Festival
DESCRIPTION:A two-day running festival featuring the 28th Annual Jane Welzel Mountain Avenue Mile on August 7th and the 43rd Annual Human Race including a Half Marathon\, 10K\, and 5K on August 8th. Registration opens May 31st.
LOCATION:Civic Center Park\, Fort Collins\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
