UID:georgetown-to-idaho-springs-half-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260808T070000Z
DTEND:20260808T110000Z
SUMMARY:Georgetown to Idaho Springs Half Marathon
DESCRIPTION:An iconic point-to-point mountain road race that winds down the Clear Creek Valley. Starting at Georgetown Lake\, the course drops 1\,000 feet in elevation to finish in historic downtown Idaho Springs.
LOCATION:Georgetown Lake\, Georgetown\, CO 80444
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:san-juan-softie-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260814T060000Z
DTEND:20260814T100000Z
SUMMARY:San Juan Softie
DESCRIPTION:San Juan Softie 100-mile Ultramarathon starting and finishing just north of Durango\, Colorado. Runs through stunning San Juan mountain terrain with approximately 19\,000 feet of elevation gain and average elevation of 10\,000 feet. Features 38-hour cut-off with start Friday 6:00 AM MT and finish Saturday 8:00 PM MT.
LOCATION:Durango\, CO (start/finish just north of Durango)
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mt-sneffels-half-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260815T080000Z
DTEND:20260815T120000Z
SUMMARY:Mt. Sneffels Half Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Run in the 'Switzerland of America' - Mt. Sneffels Half Marathon\, 10K\, and Kids Fun Run. Benefiting the Mount Sneffels Education Foundation\, which has funded over $1.5 million into over 865 programs enriching the lives of Ouray County children.
LOCATION:TBD
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:leadville-trail-10k-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260815T060000Z
DTEND:20260815T100000Z
SUMMARY:Leadville Trail 10K
DESCRIPTION:The Life Time Leadville Trail 100 MTB is one of the most prestigious endurance cross-country mountain bike events in the world. This 105.3-mile out-and-back course traverses the Colorado Rockies with 12\,304 feet of elevation gain\, reaching a peak elevation of 12\,500 feet at Columbine Mine. Riders tackle steep climbs and technical descents across forest service roads\, high alpine two-track\, and singletrack terrain.
LOCATION:Corner of 6th St & Harrison\, Leadville\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mount-sneffels-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260815T080000Z
DTEND:20260815T120000Z
SUMMARY:Mount Sneffels Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Run in the 'Switzerland of America' - Half Marathon\, 10K\, and Kids Fun Run benefiting the Mount Sneffels Education Foundation\, which has funded over $1.5 million into programs enriching Ouray County children since 1992.
LOCATION:TBD
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:staunton-rocks-marathon-and-half-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260821T070000Z
DTEND:20260821T110000Z
SUMMARY:Staunton Rocks! Marathon and Half Marathon
DESCRIPTION:A challenging trail race in Staunton State Park featuring high-altitude singletrack and panoramic mountain views.
LOCATION:Staunton State Park\, 12102 S Elk Creek Rd\, Pine\, CO 80470
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:leadville-trail-100-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260822T040000Z
DTEND:20260822T080000Z
SUMMARY:Leadville Trail 100 Run
DESCRIPTION:The Life Time Leadville Trail 100 RUN presented by La Sportiva is one of the oldest and most iconic ultramarathons in the world. This brutal 100-mile out-and-back ultramarathon course reaches a peak elevation of 12\,500+ feet on Hope Pass and includes over 15\,000 feet of elevation gain across steep climbs\, high-altitude passes\, and technical terrain in the Colorado Rockies. Runners start at 10\,200 feet and face extreme high-altitude conditions. Big buckle awarded for sub-25 hour finishes; small buckle for sub-30 hour finishes.
LOCATION:Corner of 6th St & Harrison\, Leadville\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bergen-peak-trail-race-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260822T070000Z
DTEND:20260822T110000Z
SUMMARY:Bergen Peak Trail Race
DESCRIPTION:Come run with us in beautiful Evergreen to the top of Bergen Peak at gorgeous Elk Meadow Park! This race day will offer a 5K race running through the lower sections of Elk Meadow Park or a Half Marathon to the top of Bergen Peak. Registration Check-in starts at 6am at the Elk Meadow trailhead access at Buchanan Park Rec Center. Races will start promptly at 7am.
LOCATION:32003 Ellingwood Trail\, Evergreen\, CO 80439
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:santa-cruz-trail-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260822T083000Z
DTEND:20260822T123000Z
SUMMARY:Santa Cruz Trail Run
DESCRIPTION:Trail run through giant redwoods in Henry Cowell Redwoods State Park featuring twisting single track\, expansive roads and paths with ocean breezes from the Santa Cruz coast. Course includes river crossings and high ridges with aid stations every 5-6 miles. Events offered: 10K\, Half Marathon\, and 30K with a 6-hour time limit for the 30K.
LOCATION:Henry Cowell Redwoods State Park\, Felton\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:arrowhead-half-marathon-5k-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260822T070000Z
DTEND:20260822T110000Z
SUMMARY:Arrowhead Half Marathon & 5K
DESCRIPTION:Trail running race part of the Vail Trail Running Series featuring well-marked routes\, aid stations\, and experienced volunteers.
LOCATION:Arrowhead\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:staunton-rocks-marathon-half-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260822T070000Z
DTEND:20260822T110000Z
SUMMARY:Staunton Rocks! Marathon & Half
DESCRIPTION:An event put on by trail runners for trail runners\, touring the renowned singletrack of Staunton State Park in Colorado's Front Range Mountains southwest of Denver. The marathon features 4\,500ft of vertical gain (90% singletrack\, 10% dirt road) with elevations ranging from 8\,200' to 9\,500'. The half marathon features 2\,200ft of vertical gain. Both courses offer 60+ mile views from overlooks\, scenic lakes and streams\, and wildlife viewing opportunities including marmots\, raptors\, elk\, mule deer\, black bears\, and mountain lions. Registration caps at 150 for each distance with 10-hour cutoff for marathon and 9-hour cutoff for half marathon.
LOCATION:Staunton State Park\, Pine\, Colorado
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mudgirl-denver-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260829T083000Z
DTEND:20260829T123000Z
SUMMARY:Mudgirl Denver
DESCRIPTION:Mudgirl is an obstacle race dedicated to women. The Denver event takes place August 29-30\, 2026 at Colorado National Speedway. Race includes obstacles\, festival activities\, finisher medals\, and post-race festivities. Minimum age 7 years old (ages 7-13 must be accompanied by an adult).
LOCATION:4281 County Road 10\, Dacono\, CO 80514\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:grand-traverse-mountain-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260905T060000Z
DTEND:20260905T100000Z
SUMMARY:Grand Traverse Mountain Run
DESCRIPTION:Point-to-point ultramarathon from Crested Butte to Aspen\, Colorado. The course follows the route of the Grand Traverse Backcountry Ski race across the Elk Mountains with over 6\,000 feet of elevation gain. Operated as a fundraising event for Crested Butte Nordic\, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.
LOCATION:Town Park\, Crested Butte\, CO to Ajax Park – 1001 S. Ute Ave\, Aspen\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:golden-harvest-half-marathon-5k10k-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260905T080000Z
DTEND:20260905T120000Z
SUMMARY:Golden Harvest Half Marathon & 5K/10K
DESCRIPTION:Family-friendly fall race featuring multiple distances including a kid's dash for ages 10 and under. Includes custom shirt\, finisher medal\, chip-timing with live results\, free photos\, and finish line snacks. Virtual participation option available. Age group awards for 5K/10K/Half Marathon. Part of the Fall Half Marathon Bundle.
LOCATION:Parking Lot South of The Westin Westminster\, 10600 Westminster Blvd\, Westminster\, CO 80020
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:the-grand-traverse-bike-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260906T080000Z
DTEND:20260906T120000Z
SUMMARY:The Grand Traverse (Bike)
DESCRIPTION:The Grand Traverse Bike is a 40-mile point-to-point mountain bike race from Crested Butte to Aspen\, CO. Part of the Grand Traverse Triple Crown series (Ski\, Run\, Bike)\, the race is operated as a fundraising event for Crested Butte Nordic\, a 501(c)(3) non-profit. The route is partially based on historic mail routes connecting the Colorado mining towns of Crested Butte and Aspen from the 1880s. General registration opens at midnight on December 1st.
LOCATION:Crested Butte\, CO to Aspen\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
