DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20260912T070000Z
DTEND:20260912T110000Z
SUMMARY:Black Squirrel Half Marathon
DESCRIPTION:A perimeter trail tour of Lory State Park featuring a mix of technical ridge-line running and fast\, hard-packed singletrack. The race offers stunning views of Horsetooth Reservoir and the Great Plains.
LOCATION:Lory State Park\, 708 Lodgepole Dr\, Bellvue\, CO 80512
STATUS:CONFIRMED
