DESCRIPTION:Separate trail running race (not part of the main series) featuring a 26K distance from Vail to Minturn with well-marked routes and aid stations.
LOCATION:Start: 352 E Meadow Dr.\, Vail\, CO | Finish: 101113 Williams St.\, Minturn\, CO
