DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20261003T053000Z
DTEND:20261003T093000Z
SUMMARY:The Bear Chase
DESCRIPTION:The Bear Chase Race Endurance Festival is a trail running event featuring 100K\, 50 Mile\, 50K\, Half Marathon\, 10K and 5K distances at Bear Creek Lake Park in Lakewood\, CO. The course is relatively fast by trail/ultra standards with 99% soft surface single track dirt trail. An excellent race for first-time trail and ultramarathoners\, offering challenging terrain and panoramic views. Organized by Aravaipa Running.
LOCATION:Bear Creek Lake Park\, Big Soda Lake Beach\, 15600 W. Morrison Road\, Lakewood\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
