UID:windsor-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260726T000000Z
DTSTART:20261004T070000Z
DTEND:20261004T110000Z
SUMMARY:Windsor Marathon
DESCRIPTION:The Windsor Marathon presented by Banner Health features multiple distances starting and ending at The Island at Pelican Lakes in Water Valley. Race includes 1 Mile Fit & Fun Run\, 5K\, 10K\, Half Marathon\, and Full Marathon with finisher lunch\, beverages\, finisher shirts and medals. Benefits Banner MD Anderson Cancer Center and local nonprofits including Windsor Community Foundation\, Health4Heroes\, and St. Jude's Children's Hospital.
LOCATION:The Island at Pelican Lakes\, Water Valley\, Windsor\, CO 80550
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
