SUMMARY:Pumpkin Pie 5K/10K
DESCRIPTION:The Pumpkin Pie 5K/10K is an annual run/walk event held at City Park in Denver\, CO. Both the 5K and 10K start at 9:00 AM. Participants receive a race logo shirt\, finisher's medal\, pumpkin pie at the finish line\, professional chip timing\, and free photo downloads. The 10K consists of two laps of the certified 5K course. Pre-race packet pickup is available on Friday\, November 20\, 2026 from 4:00–7:00 PM at Runners Roost (1685 S Colorado Blvd\, Denver\, CO 80222). A virtual participation option is also available. The event is designated as an official BOLDERBoulder Qualifier.
LOCATION:City Park\, 2001 Steele St\, Denver\, CO 80205
